# narration audio is fully migrated to Vercel Blob (see prisma/migrate-audio-to-blob.ts
# and AudioAsset.audioUrl) — these local files are generation source/cache only.
# Vercel does NOT honor .gitignore for anything under public/ (it always bundles
# public/ regardless, to avoid accidentally breaking normal static assets), so this
# needs its own explicit exclusion or every deploy re-uploads 1.4GB+ of dead weight
# and blows past the CLI's 15,000-file-per-deploy limit (confirmed: 22,644 files
# without this, deploy rejected outright).
/public/audio/
